IMPORTANT: Scope your response to fit under this existing parent item:
  ID: feat-1
  Level: feature
  Title: Invoice generation

Only create children appropriate for a feature. For example, if the parent is an epic, create features and tasks. If the parent is a feature, create only tasks.
Do NOT create a new epic — instead use the parent's title as the epic title in your response.

Project context (from documentation):
--- README.md ---
# Widget Service

