  - [feature] Invoice generation (pending) (id: feat-1)
    - [task] Render invoice PDF (completed)

Descriptions to add:
1. Add dunning emails.
2. Add a billing audit log.

Respond with ONLY a valid, minified JSON array — no whitespace between tokens, no indentation, no line breaks. No explanation, no markdown fences, no commentary, and do not restate the input — just the JSON."
`;

